         "text": "Start from \\( \\frac{1}{1 - u} = 1 + u + u^{2} + u^{3} + \\cdots \\). Replace \\( u \\) by \\( -x \\), raising the whole of \\( -x \\) to each power. Through degree 2, \\( \\frac{1}{1 + x} \\approx 1 - x + x^{2} \\).",
